# Model of /srv/ppf/<environment>/private.env: private anti-fraud settings, kept on the server only
# (CLAUDE.md, section 11: thresholds and anti-fraud rules stay out of the repository). The real file
# holds the values; this model only names the variables. Without the file, the server uses the safe
# defaults written in its code.
#
# Votes (Décider, D-110):
# PPF_VOTE_POW_REGISTER=      bits of proof of work to register a voting account
# PPF_VOTE_POW_TOKENS=        bits of proof of work for each request of tokens
# PPF_VOTE_POW_BALLOT=        bits of proof of work for each anonymous ballot (12 at most)
# PPF_VOTE_MAX_TOKENS_PER_REQUEST=   tokens delivered per request at most
# PPF_VOTE_MIN_DISPLAY=       during a vote, a level column with fewer ballots than this stays hidden
